WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.290
Okay, let's take a break!

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.040
Oh, you're studying?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.490
Oh, yes...

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.130
In a place like this?

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:16.040
Ever since we started Earphones,
I've been leaving school early more often.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:21.000
If I don't do all my homework
and reports properly, it'll be bad.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.680
I see... Must be hard to have
school and work at the same time.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.710
Do your best, middle schooler!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.520
l will.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.420
Wow, these are amazing!

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.470
Study notes?

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.590
Wow, they're kind of cute.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.220
My best friend, Sayo-chan, always writes them for me.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.480
Oh, the girl at the event-

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.190
That girl?

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.910
Yes!

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:49.110
We've been friends ever since kindergarten.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.960
So you're childhood friends, huh?

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.250
She really is a good friend.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.290
Yes!

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.780
Must be nice to be young!

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.920
Kaibara-san!

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.260
About the interview I told you about earlier-

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.790
It'll be on Saturday.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:03.820
Okay!

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:08.580
Um, didn't you say there was
no way it would be on Saturday?

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:13.770
Well, they said that was
the only day they could do it...

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:14.820
Ah, sorry 'bout that.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:19.360
Oh, that's'fine. I understand...

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.090
I'm sorry!

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.760
I'm really sorry, Sayo-chan!

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:56.800
It's fine!

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.800
Don't worry about it so much.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.390
It's work, so it can't be helped.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.620
But...

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.980
Coffee Shop Donguri's Deluxe Mountain
Big Parfait is only sold during the summer...

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.270
And we've tried every year
to finish it, the two of us...

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:14.280
And we haven't been able to go yet this year...

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.760
It's fine!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.780
Even though it's only sold during the summer,

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.760
they'll still have it
until the end of the month!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.120
I'm sorry.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.000
Even though we keep saying we'll go,
we haven't been able to because of my work...

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.590
Come on, smile! Smile!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.020
That's right.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:41.010
You know that I'm your
number one fan, right, Rin-chan?

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.450
I'm always cheering you on the hardest!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.200
Thank you, Sayo-chan!

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.140
I know! Let's go today!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.580
But I have a student-teacher
conference after school today.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.040
Today's Conferences
Kudo Erina
Kohana Rin
Sato Yuta

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:54.440
But I have a student-teacher
conference after school today.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.130
I'll wait for you!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.130
Sayo-chan...

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:03.630
We'll always, always be together, right?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.310
Sayo-chan!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:11.460
Together, together! We'll always be together!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.630
We'll be together forever!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:23.610
Counseling Office

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.030
Apply for another school...?
Counseling Office

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.030
Apply for another school...?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.970
That's right.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.440
In high school, attendance will affect your
ability to be promoted to the next grade.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:35.540
It'll be hard for you to work at the same time.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.490
If you're going to continue acting,
rather than stay at our school,

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:43.490
I would recommend you take an
entrance exam for a different school

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:46.370
where you can continue
those activities more easily.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.300
Please talk to your parents
and decide what you want to do

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.460
by the next parent-teacher conference.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.750
A different school...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.740
But then, I'll have to leave Sayo-chan...

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.030
Rin-chan!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.600
You're done with your conference?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.020
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.290
Um, yeah.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.060
What's wrong? Did the
teacher say something to you?

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:18.130
No, she just said that I
shouldn't be absent so much...

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:19.920
Is everything okay?

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.320
Yeah!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.590
I'll talk to my manager about it.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.260
I see.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.090
Then, let's go!

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.100
We were so close last year!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.330
But I'm sure we can finish
the whole thing this year!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.290
I was thinking that if we
ate the ice cream, fruit,

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:42.550
Sayo-chan's been with me forever, ever since we were four.
and whipped cream in that order, we could definitely finish the whole thing!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.870
Closed temporarily?

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.370
Aw, that's too bad!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.660
We actually came together, too.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.580
Japanese Confectionery Kohana-ya

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.800
I'm home!
Japanese Confectionery Kohana-ya

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.570
Welcome back!

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.410
Hey, come over here for a second!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.970
What is it, Mom?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.140
My photo album?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.180
An anime magazine said
they would be doing a special

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:17.250
on different seiyuu when
they were in kindergarten!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.380
What?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:21.130
Look, I was going to use this one.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.420
Huh? But, this is a little...

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.150
But you're the most visible
in this picture, you know.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.600
The others are all like this.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:37.330
Back then, you really were so shy...

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.340
Rin-chan, what do you want to be when you grow up?

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.090
A cucumber.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.740
M-Mom, stop talking about that already...

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:54.240
We put you in a children's theater troupe
to see if it would make you less shy,

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:59.750
but for you to continue as a seiyuu after being
a child actor, and now even be part of a unit...

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.960
It's hard to believe, isn't it?

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.810
Yeah.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.800
By the way, how was your
conference with your teacher?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.640
Oh, yeah... It was the same as usual.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:11.700
The same as usual?

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.470
You mean she said you
shouldn't be absent so much?

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:16.460
Yeah...

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:22.020
Oh, I can make up for it by
writing reports and stuff, so it's fine.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.040
Really?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.980
Yeah, it's fine, it's fine!

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.300
Yeah...

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.700
Hello! I'm Sayo-chan!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:35.850
Nice to meet you!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.170
Why are you hiding?

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:42.250
Let's play, Rin-chan!

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.710
Come on, let's play! I said, come on!

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:49.300
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:53.180
Rin-chan! Come on! Let's play!

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.810
Come on, come on!

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.770
Help...

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:02.350
Oh, no! I'll save you!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.360
Just you wait...!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:25.980
No way. I can't be separated from Sayo-chan...

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.530
All right, here's our first message!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.540
Yay! Yay!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.520
From a listener named Hirokichi-

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.920
"What memories do you have of junior high?"

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.460
i l
I
Memories of junior high?

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.380
I
I have so many, I can't choose right now.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.780
Yeah, that's true.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.720
Oh, Rin-chan, you're in junior high right now, right?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.490
Right? Your memories should still be fresh!

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:58.450
How was your school excursion?

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.970
Oh, I had work, so I didn't go.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.020
Oh? Then, what about the athletic festival?

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.090
Urn, I've never been to one...

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.920
What? You're kidding!

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.230
It's true!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.590
Then, what about the cultural festival?

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.760
I couldn't go. I had work that day...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.840
Then, what about Comiket?

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.100
You've at least been to Comiket, right?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.300
No, I haven't had a job there...

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.690
Not for work, it's the duty of a citizen!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.440
What?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.230
Then, what about Wonder Festival?
Or World Hobby Festival? Or Anisama?

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.050
Huh? Um... uh...

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.320
Saving up money from your part-time job
to take the night bus to Kansai,

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.620
buying doujinshi at lntex Osaka-

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.370
It's an experience unique to students!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.640
Don't tell me you've never done it, Rin-chan!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.580
No, I don't think most students have done any of that.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.400
What? Seriously?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.300
Ichigo, while we're at it, I should tell you-

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.070
I really haven't done anything
other people do normally...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.700
Huh? What is it?

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.660
What you think is common sense
isn't that common...

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:07.310
Did something happen, Rin-chan?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.670
You seem kind of down, huh?

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.340
Um...

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:18.520
Have you ever had doubts?
About whether you could continue being a seiyuu?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.290
Huh? What's this all of a sudden?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.270
I have.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.870
You have?

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:25.870
You haven't?

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:30.310
Huh? Well, it's not like I haven't... I guess?

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:32.130
You have, right?

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.670
Yeah, well...

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:37.380
When I wasn't getting any work,
or when it wasn't going well...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.850
At times like that, I would wonder
if it was okay to continue like this-

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.580
If I <i>could</i> continue like this...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:49.650
And like when I had no money and had
to survive for three days on pauper's meals-

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:50.480
Huh?

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.840
That's right, the ultimate meal
my senpai recommended to me-

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:55.960
Ingredient-less curry!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.030
For some reason, it actually
tastes good, doesn't it?

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:01.240
Yup, yup!

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.850
Is that right?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.270
But in the end, I've been able to continue.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:09.920
Yeah, right?

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:14.110
It's the dream I yearned for,
worked hard at, and finally made into reality.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:16.920
I can't quit that easily!

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:21.030
I...

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:26.540
...didn't choose this work
because it's what I wanted...

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:32.040
I just kind of continued after being
in the children's theater troupe.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:37.360
Rin, you're so shy,
so do you want to try acting?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:42.840
It's not like I chose it myself
like Futaba-san or lchigo-san...

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:49.750
I feel like I'm really halfhearted about this...

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.500
Rin-chan!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.100
Huh?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.130
There you are!

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:57.150
This person is Rin's manager-koro.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.420
Oh, hello.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:01.480
You've got a job!

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.640
An anime movie!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.490
You'll be recording all day this Friday!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.600
Huh? Oh, is that right...?

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.370
That's right! On top of that,
you'll be playing a little sister-

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.150
That HiroC's little sister!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.360
HicoC?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.420
You'll be playing
Kamiya Hiroshi-san's little sister.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.050
Kamiya Hiroshi-san...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.550
That's right! That Kamiya-san...!

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.970
Here, this is the script.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.230
R-Right...

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:36.760
The director said he wanted
a real 15-year-old's acting.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.400
That's why he chose you, Rin-chan.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.300
And it's a pretty important part, too.
In the story...

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:43.820
A real... 15-year-old...?
And it's a pretty important part, too.
In the story...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.600
I wonder if I can do it...

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.840
Can I act like a real 15-year-old...?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.010
My character, Mina,
is a normal junior high schooler

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.550
whose older brother is a famous patissier...

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:19.720
Good morning!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.990
It's Kamiya Hiroshi-san!

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.460
G-Good morning!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.980
Whoa, you surprised me!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:36.710
There's a high school girl
in uniform in the studio!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.610
Huh?

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:42.410
Oh, no, I'm still in junior high...

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:45.630
And, um, I'm playing your little sister...

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.130
You're playing my sister?

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:52.510
I see. Sorry, you just surprised me.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.840
Hello, I'm your big brother, Hiroshi.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:57.390
Nice to meet you.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.470
N-Nice to meet you...

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:05.150
Oh, I'm Kohana Rin from
the Sakurambo Theatre Group.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.320
I'm Nijo, the director.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.600
I'm looking forward to
working with you all today.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.490
Looking forward to working with you!

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:19.100
This movie, Weekend Patissier,
will play across the country,

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.280
This director chose me...

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:25.170
and recording will take a long time

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:29.930
...but I wonder if I'll be all right?
but in the second half of the movie...

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:34.180
All right, let's start with
the dry run for roll 1.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:35.630
Really?

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.640
Yeah, really. At this rate,
there won't be enough meringue!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.020
Is the genoise done?

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.800
A real 15-year-old... A real 15-year old...
Who made these macarons?

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.560
This is practically marshmallow!
A real 15-year-old... A real 15-year old...

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.080
A real 15-year-old...
This is practically marshmallow!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:46.900
A real 15-year-old...

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.730
Oh? Did you really make this, Mina?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:15:01.070
Y-Yeah, I always watch you make it,
so I wanted to try, too...

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:03.920
But for some reason, it didn't rise much...

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.870
It's really good.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.290
You really mean it?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.830
Okay, let's stop there.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:10.880
Kohana-san...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.930
Yes?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:16.220
She sounds a little too
reasonable for a 15-year-old.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.530
Sorry...

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:25.010
Um, uh, I always watch you...

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.860
Oh? Did you really make this, Mina?

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:35.060
Y-Yeah, I always watch you make it,
so I wanted to try, too...

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:37.870
But for some reason, it didn't rise much...

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.610
It's really good.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.030
You really mean it?

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:42.740
Let's stop there.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.200
That just sounds like an elementary schooler...

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.850
S-Sorry...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.510
Good work. Let's take a break.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.710
Is there a good lunch place around here?

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:59.020
The Chinese buffet on the corner is good.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.090
A real 15-year-old...

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.880
I don't think I can do it after all...

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:13.140
Oh? You're not going to lunch, Kohana-san?

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:16.830
Oh, no, I wanted to read over
the script one more time...

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.950
Oh? You're so composed, Kohana-san.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:29.530
Composed? Me? But I'm always unsure...

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.740
No, that's not true.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:38.730
I mean, when I was fifteen,
all I thought about were games and manga.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.560
That's how I was at fifteen.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.260
R-Really?

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.550
Have a seat.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:48.070
Oh, excuse me.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:54.070
That's why I think you're
really amazing, Kohana-san.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.640
I feel pressure really easily.

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.400
Pressure?

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:01.570
Yup.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:07.110
But you're needed by so many people,
and you always play so many parts so well-

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:08.840
That's not true.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.090
What?

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:15.250
I never have any confidence in myself,
I get depressed easily,

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:18.210
and I'm pretty negative and think too much.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.460
It doesn't take much to make me feel like
I don't want to go to the studio anymore.

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:22.220
What?

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.800
I always have so much to improve on...

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:27.980
Seriously, I always feel like
I'm not cut out for this work...

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:35.490
The original work...? Oh...

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:39.980
Was Kamiya-san was planning
on re-reading the script, too?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:46.030
Even if we seiyuu only work
on this movie for one day,

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:49.250
a lot of people have spent
a long time making it.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:55.010
The original creator, producers,
director, scriptwriter, animators...

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.000
every Tuesday
at 11:00 pm~
Sore ga Seiyuu!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:57.010
<b>Sore ga Seiyuu!
every Tuesday
at 11:00 pm~</b>

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:01.140
They've spent an amazing
amount of time and effort on this.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:04.630
And as part of that group,
we seiyuu have also been entrusted

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:09.650
with the important role of
giving these characters voices.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.930
That's why I feel like
I have to live up to that trust.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.230
Live up to that trust...

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:27.360
Even someone like Kamiya-san
thinks about those things

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:30.170
and polishes his acting even more.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:32.740
This is a true chou à la crème!

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:34.130
Then I have to work harder!
This is a true chou à la crème!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.200
Then I have to work harder!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.550
There's so much I don't know!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.820
Onii-chan, I'll try it!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:19:00.140
I'll work hard to become a patissier like you!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:08.780
Okay, that was great! That's a wrap!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.250
Let's hurry up and go, Rin-chan!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.180
Today, we'll definitely have
the Deluxe Mountain Big Parfait!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:30.130
Rin-chan, is something wrong?

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.400
Sayo-chan...

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.660
You know...

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:51.190
I... I'm going to take an entrance exam...
for a different high school.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:58.580
I want to work harder at being a seiyuu.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:02.840
That's why I'm thinking of going to a
high school with an acting department...

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:08.100
I'm sorry, Sayo-chan.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:12.800
Even though we promised
to always, always be together...

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.240
Rin-chan....!

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.600
Will you be okay without me?

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.640
What?

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:27.410
I mean, ever since we first met,
you've always followed me around, right?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:31.820
I don't wanna if Sayo-chan's not there...

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:38.530
But ever since you first started working,
you've gotten stronger, little by little...

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:44.040
I'm glad! You're okay by yourself now, right?

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.140
Rin-chan!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.540
I'm sad...

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.210
There's no way I wouldn't be sad.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.840
But...

00:20:55.840 --> 00:21:00.470
Even if we go to different high schools,
we can still hang out on our days off.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:03.810
So we'll still be together forever!

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:10.560
You know that I'm your
number one fan, right, Rin-chan?

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.370
I'll always cheer you on the hardest!

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:15.870
Sayo-chan!

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.130
Rin-chan!

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:23.120
Thank you, Sayo-chan!

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.310
Rin-chan!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.430
Sayo-chan!

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:35.400
Let's eat!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.520
It's delicious!

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.530
I feel like this is the year
we'll be able to eat it all!

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.180
Me, too!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:48.640
But, Sayo-chan-

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.660
Let's come back together next year, too!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.280
Yeah!

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:56.160
Next year, and the year after that!

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:57.570
And the year after that, too!

00:21:57.570 --> 00:21:59.570
And the year after the year after that!

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:01.660
We'll always, always...

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:03.050
...be together!

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:32.310
Okay, we have some listener mail!

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:33.770
It's a message from a
listener called Pucchi-san!

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:35.980
"Please explain how to make the ingredient-less
curry lchigo-chan was talking about!

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.900
I was waiting for this! It's easy to make!

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:39.760
Just boil solid blocks of curry roux in water!

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.500
Then, put it on rice, and you get this!

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:42.280
What, you made it ?

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:43.620
Oh, it really is good!

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:44.770
No way... It's delicious!

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.540
oozei no hito ga kakawatte
There are many people involved

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:52.750
minna no te de sakuhin wa umaremasu
Everyone creates the product together

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:56.000
sono ichiin toshite ganbarimasu
I'll work hard as a part of that!

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.840
Okay, we've got a request!

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:00.470
From <i>Revolutionary Girl Utena</i>,
"Rondo"!

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:05.850
isagiyoku kakkoyoku ashita kara wa
Starting tomorrow, I'll be such a heroic, stylish woman

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:09.780
daremo ga furimuku onna ni naru
everyone will turn to look at me

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:13.100
tatoe futari hanarebanare ni natte mo
Even if the two of us are torn apart,

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:16.150
kokoro wa zutto issho ni
our hearts will always be together

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:18.190
Okay, let's keep going!

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:19.230
Ready, go!
